  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan treats the ghost face red lotus in the River of Time as holding Spectral Soul’s will, almost all of Shadow Sect’s cultivation details, and a portion of that true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1403
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After merging wills with Spectral Soul’s will, Fang Yuan receives an enormous body of information whose most valuable part is Spectral Soul’s true inheritance, the most comprehensive cultivation content Spectral Soul Demon Venerable created. He judges that cultivating according to it could approach the heights Spectral Soul once reached, and that among the venerable true inheritances he holds, this one is the most complete. Spectral Soul’s will then addresses him as sect leader and states that he has completely inherited Shadow Sect, while warning that cultivating those true inheritances still demands vast time, energy, and resources.",
      "chapters": [
        1435
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "complete-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under light of wisdom, Fang Yuan derives immortal killer move Ghost Official Garment from Spectral Soul true inheritance, a defensive set that defends against heaven’s will and other Gu Immortals’ deductions, ranked across ranks six through nine, and he modifies it so other Immortal Gu can replace missing cores.",
      "chapters": [
        1447
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "defensive-killer-move-derived",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_ghost_official_garment",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan activates immortal killer move Split Soul, taken from Spectral Soul’s true inheritance and modified so he can use it, and he also practises soul suppression, soul howl, soul explosion, devour soul, soul replacement, soul beast summoning, and related moves from that store of methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1471
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "split-soul-and-related-moves",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_split_soul"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan treats hundred million man soul as only midway in Spectral Soul true inheritance’s soul cultivation records, far from the peak. That record places desolate soul above hundred million man soul, and names the peak form three headed thousand arms demon soul, which Fang Yuan had already witnessed in Spectral Soul’s giant main body.",
      "chapters": [
        1505
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-cultivation-ladder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "With Dang Hun Mountain and Luo Po Valley as soul cultivation sacred lands plus the world’s top soul cultivation techniques in Spectral Soul true inheritance, his soul foundation soars, and he treats that power as enough for a human soul to make up for and later surpass its innate weakness.",
      "chapters": [
        1509
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sacred-lands-pairing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While fighting Feng Jiu Ge, Fang Yuan notes that his yama child uses soul beast modification, soul beast summoning, and other methods within Spectral Soul true inheritance, with ghostly concealment at the core.",
      "chapters": [
        1577
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yama-child-methods",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While soul searching captives, if Dang Hun Mountain and Luo Po Valley are soul cultivation sacred lands, Fang Yuan’s Spectral Soul true inheritance stands as the number one soul path sacred scripture.",
      "chapters": [
        1615
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sacred-scripture-ranking",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    }
  ],
